---
description: Frontend work must inspect existing design system and supplied references before implementation
globs:
  - "**/*.tsx"
  - "**/*.jsx"
  - "**/*.vue"
  - "**/*.blade.php"
  - "**/*.css"
  - "**/*.scss"
---

- Search for reusable project components before creating new ones.
- Inspect relevant frontend docs and design-system conventions.
- When Figma, screenshots, templates or legacy screens are referenced, understand them before coding.
- Treat references as input, not permission to replace current architecture.
- Do not invent new visual primitives when existing ones fit.
- Ask only material design questions that cannot be inferred.
